      "content": "Those archetypes are a good start. I want to make them feel even more grounded in the city's social fabric to give it that authentic noir feel. Could you go into more detail for two of them—the gang hustler and the cartel enforcer? Specifically, I'm looking for their names, physical descriptions, and their ethnic/racial backgrounds so I can start casting them in my head. I want them to feel like they truly belong to the specific neighborhoods they operate in.",
